  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: <b>MyVirtualGrasp</b> is the main component responsible of starting,
      updating and stopping the VirtualGrasp engine in your project.<br/>. You will
      find <b>MyVirtualGrasp.cs</b> in the the Runtime/Scripts folder
