    m_Untranslated: "If the instruction below is not checked, it seems you do not
      have an avatar in your scene.<br/> In the Runtime/Resources/GleechiHands folder,
      you will find for example <b>GleechiRig</b> which is the default avatar for
      VG.  \n\nNote that in the free version of VirtualGrasp only the <b>GleechiRig</b>
      hand is supported."
